.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH conflicts 1  "conflicts " 
.SH NAME
conflicts \- Inspect divergent document variants
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBconflicts\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect divergent document variants
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
conflicts\-list(1)
List all divergent paths in a synchronized folder
.TP
conflicts\-show(1)
Show every variant for one conflicting path
.TP
conflicts\-resolve(1)
Remove acknowledged conflict artifacts without changing synced entries
.TP
conflicts\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
